| x10 (extra zero) | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |
| /10 (dropped zero) | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |
| x100 (lakh read as crore-scale) | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |
| /100 | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |
| two adjacent digits swapped | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |
| off by one rupee | 152 | 0 | 0.0% |

